      <h1 class="article-title">The Art of the Souk: Why Bargaining in Marrakech is a Conversation, Not Combat</h1>
      <p class="article-subtitle">
        Forget what Western guidebooks tell you about haggling. In Morocco, bargaining in the souk is an ancient ritual of hospitality, acquaintance, and dignity. Learn authentic etiquette from local guides.
      </p>
      <div class="article-meta">
        <span>Published: <strong>September 28, 2026</strong></span>
        <span>Author: <strong>Hamza &amp; Abdelhakim (Roam Morocco Co-Founders)</strong></span>
